OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, lands dream gig opening
OL,4,Afor The Libertines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old rising star found out he
OL,7,Flanded a dream gig as one of the
OL,8,Fsupport acts for indie rock band The
OL,9,FLibertines on the same day he received
OL,10,Fhis GCSE results.
OL,12,FKit Bottomley, a singer-songwriter from
OL,13,FKnebworth, Hertfordshire, will perform
OL,14,Fa mix of poetic lyrics, indie rock and
OL,15,Flooping guitar when he opens the show
OL,16,Fat Hitchin Live on Saturday.
OL,18,FThe Libertines, led by frontmen Carl
OL,19,FBarat and Pete Doherty, are among the
OL,20,Fheadliners at the bank holiday weekend
OL,21,Fopen-air festival, which is expected to
OL,22,Fattract about 40,000 people.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
