OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, lands dream gig opening
OL,4,Afor The Libertines
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To go from opening my GCSE results to
OL,7,Fdiscovering I'm opening for The
OL,8,FLibertines is completely surreal," said
OL,9,FBottomley.
